## Key Concepts

- Data quality scoring and thresholds
- Versioned schema validation
- DLQ routing and replay backfill
- Idempotent writes with DynamoDB
- Parquet storage in S3 with region/date partitioning
- Observability (CloudWatch, X-Ray)

